{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"33273","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v25936","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"フェイトリネ-アルファ","creatorId":"vndb:s11936","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11936","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11936","name":"フェイトリネ-アルファ","roleCode":"art","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157714","source":"vndb"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"Waffle","creatorId":"vndb:s29887","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29887","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29887","name":"Waffle","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157716","source":"vndb"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"Zack Parrish","creatorId":"vndb:s12287","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12287","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12287","name":"Zack Parrish","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157715","source":"vndb"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"Badriel","creatorId":"vndb:s1838","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1838","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1838","name":"Badriel","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157712","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Inma Ruiz","creatorId":"vndb:s8024","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8024","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8024","name":"Inma Ruiz","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157713","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Exilim","creatorId":"vndb:s29888","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29888","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29888","name":"Exilim","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157717","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c151535","characterName":"Aina","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c151535"},"originalCharacterName":"Aina","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/56b09cdb8c914ecfb7cf3763ccc35a101276fc8d00b4ed7d8fc456b27abfdd73.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7f3e6637c58006cfdd2226b468f8982b841c5dc2719d555da8065367b0af51d7.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c75774","characterName":"Viola","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c75774"},"originalCharacterName":"Viola","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Viola is the name Kotone gave to her character in Asaph Online. Upon awakening in Asaph, Kotone inherits Viola’s appearance, her magical powers, and her name."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Viola is a dark witch with unimaginable powers, who is feared by everybody in Asaph. Many have tried to challenge her, but none have emerged victorious. She enjoys grinding people down beneath her heel (sometimes literally), and treats those around her as little more than playthings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s a deeply sadistic, dangerous woman… but even she has a soft side."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c75774"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/83ead0696d623b52de18974473454ab1a0244caa3a483990178d2884f626a4b8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/429a6f583593bc926cb2cd8fc2ff336b94accafb4afd2893f04be9613690930e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c75775","characterName":"Neve","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c75775"},"originalCharacterName":"Neve","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Neve is Viola’s trusted most trusted maid, who would do anything to help her mistress."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Neve is a member of the darkling race, which is reviled throughout Asaph as being savage and hostile, but Neve eschews these unfair perceptions. She is a diligent, loyal, industrious girl – but she may be a touch too devoted. She adores Viola, and becomes irrationally angry at any perceived slights against her beloved mistress."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Self-sacrificing and hard-working though she is, Neve can be rather scary when she wants. If she were to fight seriously, she may even be able to defeat demons."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c75775"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/238d1394014c7641382d5ace9bde0647407926cee8b19eb337ace9807eb6bf20.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d529818446393856cca0d6bb352cd42f46aff0adad9221b09b40104fad2bfcb.webp","width":182,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c75776","characterName":"Fion","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c75776"},"originalCharacterName":"Fion","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fion is a young, put-upon lass from a huge family, who works hard to ensure all her brothers and sisters have enough food to eat. At least, that’s what she says, but Neve isn’t entirely convinced."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fion might look like a sweet, innocent thing, looks can be deceiving, and she’s far craftier than she initially appears."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c75776"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/51/51368aea70db1180fff1ce0ad7fd0c54b86825fc3883720223150f61a4cee3d9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/22/225576b5632ee99dcd44135c59d280e80bf49715c510671ff15307f1ae843aca.webp","width":174,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c77045","characterName":"Eleri","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c77045"},"originalCharacterName":"Eleri","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Eleri is a noble knight who believes deeply in playing fair, and will never try to take advantage of her opponents – often to her own detriment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though Eleri seems cool and competent, she gets flustered quite easily, and reacts poorly to being teased. She’s quite fun to bully, really – and Viola often derives pleasure from her embarrassed reactions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though Neve and Fion believe Eleri to be a resident of Asaph, much like them, she actually comes from Japan, much like Viola. Eleri was brought to Asaph in the same way Viola was, and now the pair of them are working together to see if they can return home."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c77045"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b549099c75f150286d207f8392e5ee388374687a284765e5e0a2452dc1500527.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/87163f039dca3956e9765e60a2f9bdbd82507698676307ae2a81695f8dd4830e.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c95145","characterName":"Gardenia","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c95145"},"originalCharacterName":"Gardenia","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A witch with more knowledge than a library could hold. A mysterious, yet easy quest leads Viola's party to her shack where Gardenia confronts the girls with a surprise: she knows about Japan and who summoned the girls into their favorite game."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from official twitter page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95145"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a1dabedab7dc5afbcd795c5fe958d0c08950d995304544760ad85d6476abb33f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/58356cf5470c631ee56f5ccebb881bf2fae2deb243741dd57c41ea62a8257ed9.webp","width":159,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c95148","characterName":"Bonnie","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c95148"},"originalCharacterName":"Bonnie","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b30301c7bf519b7b596bf2edee25966a120b2bb3c541b93312ec4bcf31